し大根に次いで、ゆでぼし大根も\n生産量を調整の上、オリジナルパッケージ化を目指す。","amounts":[],"indicators":[],"ratings":[],"evidence":[{"sourceUrl":"https://www.city.saikai.nagasaki.jp/material/files/group/2/r73teireigian45seika.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.city.saikai.nagasaki.jp/material/files/group/2/r73teireigian45seika.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T08:46:02.052Z","sha256":"2906f6733f08bc24eec3752c30ccee21f372aa5498bc08b34ca43aaf9bfe569a","rawText":"事業名称\n\n特産品ブランド力強化対策事業（Ｐ224～233）","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:136714-136744"},{"sourceUrl":"https://www.city.saikai.nagasaki.jp/material/files/group/2/r73teireigian45seika.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.city.saikai.nagasaki.jp/material/files/group/2/r73teireigian45seika.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T08:46:02.052Z","sha256":"2906f6733f08bc24eec3752c30ccee21f372aa5498bc08b34ca43aaf9bfe569a","rawText":"令和６年度\n\n主要施策成果説明書","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:0-16"},{"sourceUrl":"https://www.city.saikai.nagasaki.jp/material/files/group/2/r73teireigian45seika.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.city.saikai.nagasaki.jp/material/files/group/2/r73teireigian45seika.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T08:46:02.052Z","sha256":"2906f6733f08bc24eec3752c30ccee21f372aa5498bc08b34ca43aaf9bfe569a","rawText":"款項目070103","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:136704-136713"},{"sourceUrl":"https://www.city.saikai.nagasaki.jp/material/files/group/2/r73teireigian45seika.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.city.saikai.nagasaki.jp/material/files/group/2/r73teireigian45seika.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T08:46:02.052Z","sha256":"2906f6733f08bc24eec3752c30ccee21f372aa5498bc08b34ca43aaf9bfe569a","rawText":"所管課\n\nふるさと資源推進課","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:136751-136765"},{"sourceUrl":"https://www.city.saikai.nagasaki.jp/material/files/group/2/r73teireigian45seika.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.city.saikai.nagasaki.jp/material/files/group/2/r73te